== Trivia ==
* The sprite of this item is identical to {{i|Teleport!}} and {{i|Doctor's Remote}}, but with a different color.
* Teleporting to the I AM ERROR room when all rooms on the map are explored is a possible failsafe for the error the item would otherwise cause, as no other valid unexplored rooms would exist at that point.
* This item is the successor to {{I|Teleport!}}.
* This item is one of four reliable ways to reach the I AM ERROR room in-game, the others being the {{i|Blank Card}} + {{p|? Card}} interaction, using {{i|Red Key}} to go beyond the 13x13 level grid, and {{i|Undefined}}.

== Bugs ==
{{Bug|After all Mini-Bosses in [[Mini-Boss Room]]s are encountered, on floors that would otherwise spawn Mini-Boss Rooms, they will not spawn, which results in Teleport 2.0 being unable to teleport Isaac to special rooms after the Mini-Boss Room in the teleport order, instead teleporting Isaac to the same room each time.}}
{{Bug|If Isaac is in {{s|Mines}} / {{s|Ashpit}} II while holding {{i|Knife Piece 1}}, and if there is no {{r|Curse Room}} in the floor, Teleport 2.0 sometimes incorrectly teleports Isaac to the room containing the minecart that leads to {{i|Knife Piece 2}}. If this happens, all further uses of Teleport 2.0 in that floor will also lead Isaac to this room.}}

